<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Silver Eagle shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Silver Eagle shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Silver Eagle Holdings Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request pending for announcement, Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at HK$1.76 on Monday.</p>
<p>Silver Eagle manufactures and retails footwear.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369  http://www.hk97.com</p>
